    skos:broader <https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/configurations/formats/folded-sheet-formats> ;
    skos:definition "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@da,
        "105 × 210 mm — halbe A4-Breite bei voller Höhe; das «Lang-DL» der deutschen Branche, breiter als DL und passt nicht mehr in den DL-Umschlag."@de,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@en,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@es,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@hi,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@ja,
        "105 × 210 mm — halve A4-bredden i full høyde (A4 brettet én gang på langs, eller stående A5); tysk bransjeformat «Lang-DL», bredere enn DL og passer ikke i DL-konvolutt."@nb,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@nl,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@pl,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@pt,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@sv,
        "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope."@zh-Hans ;
